{"id": "10th-u8-q009", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kaniyan_poongundran_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"யாதும் ஊரே யாவரும் கேளிர்; தீதும் நன்றும் பிறர்தர வாரா\" - என்ற உலகளாவிய மானுட ஒருமைப்பாட்டு அறத்தை முழங்கிய சங்கப் புலவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கணியன் பூங்குன்றனார்", "B": "நக்கீரர்", "C": "ஒளவையார்", "D": "பக்குடுக்கை நன்கணியார்"}, "explanation": "புறநானூற்றில் கணியன் பூங்குன்றனார் \"எல்லா ஊரும் எம் ஊரே, எல்லா மனிதரும் எம் உறவினரே\" என்ற உலகளாவிய மானுட நேய அறத்தை நிலைநாட்டினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which philosopher-poet in Purananuru proclaimed: \"Every town is my native home, every human is my kin; good and evil come not from others\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kaniyan Poongundranaar", "B": "Nakkeerar", "C": "Avvaiyar", "D": "Pakkudukkai Nankaniyar"}, "explanation": "Kaniyan Poongundranaar articulated this cosmic vision of universal kinship."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null