{"id": "10th-u8-q010", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "unselfish_living_undal_amma", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"உண்டால் அம்ம இவ்வுலகம்... தமக்கென முயலா நோன்தாள் பிறர்க்கென முயலுநர் உண்மையானே\" - என்ற புறநானூற்றுப் பாடலின் ஆசிரியர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நெடுஞ்செழியன்", "B": "கடலுள் மாய்ந்த இளம்பெருவழுதி", "C": "சேரன் செங்குட்டுவன்", "D": "கரிகாலன்"}, "explanation": "கடலுள் மாய்ந்த இளம்பெருவழுதி: \"தமக்கென வாழாமல் பிறருக்காக வாழும் சான்றோர்கள் இருப்பதால்தான் இந்த உலகம் இன்றும் நிலைத்து இயங்குகிறது\" என்று பாடியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who composed the profound Purananuru verse asserting that the world survives only because of altruists who live selflessly for others?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nedunchezhiyan", "B": "Kadalul Maaintha Ilamberuvazhuthi", "C": "Cheran Senguttuvan", "D": "Karikalan"}, "explanation": "King Kadalul Maaintha Ilamberuvazhuthi composed this immortal verse."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்", "இளம்பெருவழுதி", "பிறர்க்கென முயலுநர்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q011", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "wounded_in_back_shame", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க காலத்தில் போரில் புறமுதுகிட்டுப் பின்வாங்கினாலோ அல்லது முதுகில் அம்பு பட்டாலோ அதனைப் பெருத்த அவமானமாகக் கருதி உண்ணாநோன்பிருந்து உயிர்நீக்கும் மரபு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மடல் ஏறுதல்", "B": "ஆநிரை மீட்டல்", "C": "வடக்கு இருத்தல் (உண்ணாநோன்பிருந்து உயிர்விடல்)", "D": "நடுகல் நடுதல் மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "முதுகில் புண்பட்டதை மாபெரும் இழுக்காகக் கருதி, மன்னர்களும் வீரர்களும் வடதிசை நோக்கி அமர்ந்து உண்ணாநோன்பிருந்து உயிர்நீக்கும் வீர அறம் \"வடக்கு இருத்தல்\" எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What heroic code of honor involved fasting unto death facing northwards if a king or warrior sustained a dishonorable wound in the back?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Madal Eruthal", "B": "Cattle rescue", "C": "Vadakku Irutthal (Fasting unto death facing North)", "D": "Hero stone installation alone"}, "explanation": "Vadakku Irutthal was the ultimate voluntary penance to vindicate warrior honor."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்", "வடக்கு இருத்தல்", "வீர அறம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "hospitality_sharing_food", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "விருந்தினரை உபசரித்து, கிடைத்த உணவை அனைவருடனும் பகிர்ந்து உண்ணும் விருந்தோம்பல் அறத்தைப் புறநானூறு எவ்வாறு போற்றுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மறைத்து வைத்து உண்ணுதல்", "B": "விருந்தினரைத் தவிர்த்தல்", "C": "பொருளைச் சேர்த்து வைத்தல்", "D": "\"இந்திரர் அமிழ்தமே இயைவதாயினும் இனிது எனத் தமியர் உண்டலும் இலரே\" (அமிழ்தமே கிடைத்தாலும் பிறருடன் பகிர்ந்து உண்பர்)"}, "explanation": "தேவாமிர்தமே கிடைத்தாலும் தான் மட்டும் தனியாக உண்ணாமல் பசித்து வந்தோர்க்குப் பகிர்ந்து கொடுத்து உண்பதே தமிழரின் உயர்ந்த இல்லற அறமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does Purananuru extol the sublime hospitality of sharing food with guests?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Hoarding food in secret", "B": "Shunning wayfarers", "C": "Stockpiling wealth", "D": "\"Even if the nectar of the celestials were obtained, they would never relish it alone in isolation\""}, "explanation": "Tamil hospitality demanded sharing even celestial nectar with hungry guests."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 179", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்", "விருந்தோம்பல் அறம்", "அமிழ்தம் பகிர்ந்து உண்ணல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q013", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "truthfulness_highest_virtue", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க இலக்கியங்கள் அறத்தின் தலையாய அடிப்படையாகப் போற்றும் நற்பண்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாய்மை (பொய் கூறாமை)", "B": "செல்வம் சேர்த்தல்", "C": "போரிடுதல் மட்டுமே", "D": "மௌனம் காத்தல்"}, "explanation": "வாய்மையே அறத்தின் தாயாகப் போற்றப்பட்டது; \"பொய்யா நல்மொழி\" எனப் புலவர்கள் வாய்மையையே மனிதனின் உன்னத அடையாளமாகக் குறிப்பிட்டனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What foundational ethical virtue is celebrated across Sangam literature as the bedrock of all righteousness?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaaimai (Unyielding Truthfulness / Integrity)", "B": "Amassing treasure", "C": "Militarism alone", "D": "Total silence"}, "explanation": "Truthfulness (Vaaimai) was held as the mother of all ethical virtues."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் அறம்", "வாய்மை", "அறத்தின் அடிப்படை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q014", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "compassion_towards_birds_pari", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முல்லைக் கொடி படர்வதற்குத் தன் தேரையே ஈந்த பாரி வள்ளலும், மயிலுக்குத் தன் போர்வையை ஈந்த பேகன் வள்ளலும் எவ்வகை உயர்ந்த அறத்திற்குச் சான்றுகளாவர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அரசியல் சூழ்ச்சி", "B": "மனிதர்களைத் தாண்டி வாயில்லா உயிர்களிடத்தும் காட்டிய எல்லையற்ற தாவர மற்றும் விலங்குநேயப் பேரறம்", "C": "செல்வச் செருக்கு", "D": "போர்ப் பயிற்சி"}, "explanation": "பாரி தேரை ஈந்ததும், பேகன் மயிலுக்குப் போர்வை ஈந்ததும் இயற்கை மற்றும் பிற உயிர்கள் மீதான எல்லையற்ற கருணையின் சிகரங்களாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "The munificence of Paari gifting his royal chariot to a wild jasmine vine and Pegan wrapping his silk cloak around a shivering peacock epitomize what ethical grandeur?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Political cunning", "B": "Boundless ecological compassion and selfless empathy embracing plants and animals beyond humanity", "C": "Arrogance of wealth", "D": "Military drills"}, "explanation": "Their deeds embody universal ecological empathy and sublime bio-compassion."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", 