{"id": "10th-u8-q017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sanga_ilakkiyatthil_aram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poverty_not_excuse_for_dishonesty", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க இலக்கிய மாந்தர்கள் எத்தகைய கொடிய சூழலிலும் எதனைக் கைவிடக் கூடாது என்று உறுதியாக நின்றனர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மானமும் மானம் காத்த அறநெறியும்", "B": "போர்க்கள வெற்றி மட்டுமே", "C": "பொருட்செல்வம்", "D": "அரசாங்க ஆதரவு"}, "explanation": "வறுமையால் வாடினாலும் தன்மானத்தை இழக்கக் கூடாது என்பதும், எளியோர்க்கு ஈயும் அறத்தைக் கைவிடக் கூடாது என்பதும் சங்கத் தமிழரின் உறுதியான நெறியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What supreme value did Sangam Tamils refuse to compromise even amidst devastating famine and starvation?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Maanam (Self-respect, honor, and righteous dignity)", "B": "Military triumph solely", "C": "Material accumulation", "D": "Royal patronage"}, "explanation": "Honor and self-respect (Maanam) were held dearer than physical survival."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "c