{"id": "10th-u8-q080", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "kaalakkanitham", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kannadasan_autobiography", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கண்ணதாசனின் சுயசரிதை நூல்களுள் சரியான தொகுப்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "என் சரிதம், என் வரலாறு", "B": "வாழ்விலே ஒரு நாள், நிழல் உலகம்", "C": "என் வாழ்க்கை முறை, நனவோடை", "D": "வனவாசம், மனவாசம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மற்றும் பொதுத் தமிழ் குறிப்பு: கண்ணதாசனின் அரசியல் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட வாழ்வின் தன்வரலாற்று நூல்கள் \"வனவாசம்\" மற்றும் \"மனவாசம்\" ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which pair represents Kannadasan's famous autobiographical volumes?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "En Saritham, En Varalaaru", "B": "Vaazhvilae Oru Naal, Nizhal Ulagam", "C": "En Vaazhkkai Murai, Nanavodai", "D": "Vanavasam and Manavasam"}, "explanation": "Vanavasam and Manavasam are Kannadasan's renowned autobiographies."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 183, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 183", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["காலக்கணிதம்", "சுயசரிதை", "வனவாசம் மனவாசம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q081", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "kaalakkanitham", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poetic_term_uruppada", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"கருப்படு பொருளை உருப்பட வைப்பேன்\" - இத்தொடரில் \"உருப்பட வைப்பேன்\" என்பதன் நேரடிப் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வடிவம் பெறச் செய்வேன் (கலையாக ஆக்குவேன்)", "B": "அழித்துவிடுவேன்", "C": "மறைத்து வைப்பேன்", "D": "விலைக்கு விற்பேன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பொருள்: மனதில் கருக்கொள்ளும் கருத்தினை ஓர் அழகிய கலையாக, வடிவமாக ஆக்குவேன் என்பது பொருள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Karuppadu porulai uruppada vaippen\", what does \"uruppada vaippen\" directly signify?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Give artistic shape and structured form", "B": "Destroy completely", "C": "Conceal secretly", "D": "Sell for a price"}, "explanation": "Transforming raw thoughts into fully realized artistic form."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 182", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["காலக்கணிதம்", "சொற்பொருள்", "உருப்பட வைப்பேன்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q082", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "kaalakkanitham", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவியரசு கண்ணதாசன் பற்றிய கீழ்க்காணும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. கண்ணதாசனின் இயற்பெயர் முத்தையா.\n2. இவர் தமிழக அரசின் அரசவைக் கவிஞராகப் பணியாற்றினார்.\n3. சேரமான் காதலி புதினத்திற்கு 1980-இல் சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்றார்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் ஆய்வு: முத்தையா என்பது இயற்பெயர், அரசவைக் கவிஞராக இருந்தார், 1980-இல் சேரமான் காதலிக்கு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி பெற்றார் - மூன்றுமே முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding Kaviarasu Kannadasan: 1. Birth name was Muthiah. 2. Served as TN State Poet Laureate. 3. Won Sahitya Akademi in 1980 for Cheraman Kadhali.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "1, 2, and 3 - All are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only", "D": "1 and 3 only"}, "explanation": "All three biographical statements are historically authentic."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 183, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 183", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["காலக்கணிதம்", "கூற்று ஆய்வு", "கண்ணதாசன்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q083", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "kaalakkanitham", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_kannadasan_works", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக:\nஅ) சேரமான் காதலி - 1. இயேசுவின் வரலாறு\nஆ) இயேசு காவியம் - 2. தத்துவ உரைநடை நூல்\nஇ) அர்த்தமுள்ள இந்துமதம் - 3. சாகித்திய அகாதெமி பெற்ற புதினம்\nஈ) இராச தண்டனை - 4. வரலாற்று நாடகம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-4, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: சேரமான் காதலி - சாகித்திய அகாதெமி புதினம்; இயேசு காவியம் - இயேசுவின் வரலாறு; அர்த்தமுள்ள இந்துமதம் - தத்துவ நூல்; இராச தண்டனை - வரலாற்று நாடகம்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match Kannadasan's masterpieces: a) Cheraman Kadhali - 1. Epic on Jesus b) Yesu Kaaviyam - 2. Philosophical prose c) Arthamulla Indhumatham - 3. Sahitya novel d) Raja Thandanai - 4. Historical play.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Correct matching is a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 183, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 183", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["காலக்கணிதம்", "பொருத்துக", "நூல்கள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q084", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "kaalakkanitham", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poetic_metaphor_akshaya_pathiram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"தத்துவம் மட்டுமே அச்சய பாத்திரம்!\" - இத்தொடரில் \"அச்சய பாத்திரம்\" எதற்கு உருவகப்படுத்தப்பட்டுள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மன்னர்களின் செல்வத்திற்கு", "B": "அரசியல் மேடைகளுக்கு", "C": "மனித உடலுக்கு", "D": "என்றும் வற்றாத அழியா தத்துவக் கருத்துகளுக்கு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: அள்ள அள்ளக் குறையாத அட்சய பாத்திரம் போல, காலந்தோறும் மனித குலத்திற்கு வழிகாட்டி வற்றாமல் நிலைத்து நிற்பது நல் தத்துவமே என்று உருவகிக்கிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Thathuvam mattumae Akshaya Paathiram\", to what is the inexhaustible vessel compared?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kings' treasures", "B": "Political podiums", "C": "Human flesh", "D": "Eternal, inexhaustible philosophical wisdom"}, "explanation": "Philosophical wisdom is likened to the inexhaustible vessel providing sustenance endlessly."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 182", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["காலக்கணிதம்", "அட்சய பாத்திரம்", "உருவகம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
// ==============================================================================
// பாடம் 4: விரிவானம் - இராமானுசர் (நாடகம்) [Q085 - Q112]
// வித்வான் வே. இலட்சுமணன்; திருக்கோட்டியூர் நம்பி, 18 முறை நடந்து செல்லுதல், ஓம் நமோ நாராயணாய எட்டெழுத்து திருமந்திரம்; கோபுரமேறி பகிரங்க உபதேசம், திருக்குலத்தார் அரவணைப்பு, மேல்கோட்டை பிரவேசம்
