{"id": "10th-u8-q166", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "paa_vagai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_analysis_paa", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பா-வகைகள் பற்றிய பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. வெண்பா செப்பலோசை கொண்டது; அறநூல்கள் வெண்பாவால் ஆனவை.\n2. கலிப்பா துள்ளலோசை உடையது; கலித்தொகை இதில் அடங்கும்.\n3. வஞ்சிப்பா அகவலோசை உடையது.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும்", "B": "1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டுமே சரி (3 தவறு: வஞ்சிப்பா தூங்கலோசை உடையது)", "C": "2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும்", "D": "1 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் ஆய்வு: வஞ்சிப்பா தூங்கலோசை உடையது. கூற்று 3-இல் அகவலோசை எனக் கூறப்பட்டிருப்பதால் அது தவறு. எனவே 1, 2 மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze statements on meters: 1. Venba has Seppal sound; ethical books use it. 2. Kalippa has Thullal sound; Kalithogai uses it. 3. Vanjippa has Agaval sound. Which are true?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All 1, 2, 3", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct (3 is false as Vanjippa has Thoongal sound)", "C": "2 and 3 only", "D": "1 and 3 only"}, "explanation": "Statement 3 is incorrect because Vanjippa has Thoongal cadence."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 187, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 187", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["பாவகை", "கூற்று ஆய்வு", "ஓசைகள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u8-q167", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "paa_vagai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_vaipaadu_complete", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (அசை வாய்ப்பாடுகள்):\nஅ) நேர் நேர் - 1. கருவிளம்\nஆ) நிரை நேர் - 2. கூவிளம்\nஇ) நிரை நிரை - 3. தேமா\nஈ) நேர் நிரை - 4. புளிமா", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: நேர் நேர் - தேமா; நிரை நேர் - புளிமா; நிரை நிரை - கருவிளம்; நேர் நிரை - கூவிளம்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match metrical feet: a) Ner Ner - 1. Karuvizham b) Nirai Ner - 2. Koovizham c) Nirai Nirai - 3. Thema d) Ner Nirai - 4. Pulima.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Correct match is a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 188, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 188", "url": n